# Derived by hand, never run: Semantics ch. 9 (the place the host answers adds nothing to the host's document, the rest is forwarded at 0/[p]/0; an event answer is the next tick's input, owed), ch. 7 (`!Updated $?l` fires in the tick the field changes) and ruling EP (a `$` field in an element pattern binds the description's own dynamic): the click moves the guest's field in tick 1, its update is the answer, and the guest hears it in tick 2.
test a_generic_tag_is_echoed

tick 0
  added:
    0/[0]/0: Ui.Button(label="press")
    0/[2]/0: Ui.Label(text="heard nothing")

tick 1
  in:
    0/[0]/0: click

tick 2
  changed:
    0/[2]/0: Ui.Label(text="heard pressed")
